[en.DECISION_C02_INVESTIGATE_DOCTOR_HOOVES]
Attempt to Report Doctor Hooves

[en.DECISION_C02_INVESTIGATE_DOCTOR_HOOVES_desc]
It is most improper for a Duchess to conduct a secret investigation on one of her government officials, who happens to be a popular candidate for the next election. However, as the eyes of the Equestria Empire Ministry of Order is basically everywhere, all one needs to do is to draft an anonymous report to make vague accusations against the target, and the Ministry will do the rest of the job in the investigation.

[zh.DECISION_C02_INVESTIGATE_DOCTOR_HOOVES]
尝试举报蹄博士

[zh.DECISION_C02_INVESTIGATE_DOCTOR_HOOVES_desc]
公爵偷偷地调查她的一位政府官员是非常不合适的，尤其是这位官员还是下届选举的热门候选。然而，因为小马利亚帝国秩序部的眼线基本上无处不在，只要起草一份匿名举报信，对目标提出含糊不清的指控，秩序部就会自动完成剩下的调查工作。
